{"text": "Then he stepped on something. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That looked like a log. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But it was really the Crocodile. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And he winked one eye. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Come closer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Little One said the Crocodile. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I am the Crocodile. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he began. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To cry crocodile tears. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To show it was true. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Elephants Child knelt down. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the bank and came closer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I have been looking for you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For so many days. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Will you please tell me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What you have for dinner. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Come closer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And I will whisper it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the Crocodile. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So the Elephants Child put his head. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Close to the Crocodiles mouth. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Snap The Crocodile caught him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> By his little nose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I think. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Today I will begin. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With Elephants Child. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the Crocodile.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "h", "e", " ", "s", "t", "e", "p", "p", "e", "d", " ", "o", "n", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", "t", "h", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "a", "t", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "e", "d", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "a", " ", "l", "o", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "u", "t", " ", "i", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "r", "e", "a", "l", "l", "y", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "C", "r", "o", "c", "o", "d", "i", "l", "e", ".", " ", "<",